er data residency and strict data controls, hosted in Atlassian’s secure environment.\",\"ctaText\":\"Explore now\",\"desktopbannerImage\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FdesktopTileImage.6a620e6da6fad0e.png\",\"tabletbannerImage\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FtabletTileImage.6a620e6da6fad0e.png\",\"mobilebannerImage\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FmobileTileImage.6a620e6da6fad0e.png\",\"redirectUrl\":\"\u002Fcollections\u002Fruns-on-atlassian\"},{\"type\":\"SPOTLIGHT_WITH_RIGHT_IMAGE\",\"heading\":\"Supercharge your DevOps workflow\",\"subHeading\":\"Accelerate delivery, automate the tedious, and optimize every stage of your DevOps lifecycle.\",\"ctaText\":\"Explore now\",\"desktopbannerImage\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FdesktopTileImage.4d976ea8ba16126.png\",\"tabletbannerImage\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FtabletTileImage.4d976ea8ba16126.png\",\"mobilebannerImage\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FmobileTileImage.4d976ea8ba16126.png\",\"redirectUrl\":\"\u002Fbundles\u002FdevopsEssentials\"},{\"type\":\"SPOTLIGHT_WITH_RIGHT_IMAGE\",\"heading\":\"Transform Your CRM Workflow\",\"subHeading\":\"Discover apps that boost customer management efficiency and drive team impact.\",\"ctaText\":\"Explore now\",\"desktopbannerImage\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FdesktopTileImage.c9316327d94f348.png\",\"tabletbannerImage\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FtabletTileImage.c9316327d94f348.png\",\"mobilebannerImage\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FmobileTileImage.c9316327d94f348.png\",\"redirectUrl\":\"\u002Fcategories\u002Fsales-customer-relations\"}]},\"featuredSection\":{\"heading\":\"Featured\",\"subHeading\":\"Experience and engage with our curated assortment of apps\",\"isShuffleEnabled\":false,\"tiles\":[{\"image\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FtileImage.f67717449c28bc5.svg\",\"title\":\"Agents\",\"description\":\"Unlock a new way of working in Jira. Automate your routine tasks and scale your team's impact.\",\"redirectUrl\":\"\u002Fcollections\u002Fjira-agents\",\"featureGate\":\"enable_coding_agents_section\"},{\"title\":\"Project Management\",\"description\":\"Streamline, manage, and track project phases.\",\"redirectUrl\":\"\u002Fcategories\u002Fproject-management\",\"image\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FtileImage.51924c5f1c1f1d4.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Software Development\",\"description\":\"Code, collaborate, and plan across every stage of the DevOps cycle.\",\"image\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FtileImage.4f7f57f47249fbd.svg\",\"redirectUrl\":\"\u002Fcategories\u002Fsoftware-development\"},{\"title\":\"Artificial intelligence\",\"description\":\"Elevate productivity with AI-powered apps to revolutionize your workflows.\",\"redirectUrl\":\"\u002Fcollections\u002Fartificial-intelligence\",\"image\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FtileImage.cef56891c3b1dfa.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Admin Tools\",\"description\":\"Manage users, security, and settings with apps for admins.\",\"redirectUrl\":\"\u002Fcategories\u002Fadmin-tools\",\"image\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FtileImage.5679e797a89bf79.svg\"},{\"title\":\"Data & Analytics\",\"description\":\"Unlock valuable insights with data visualization and analytics tools.\",\"image\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FtileImage.0d9d3101fd48c1b.svg\",\"redirectUrl\":\"\u002Fcategories\u002Fdata-analytics\"},{\"image\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FtileImage.5353c51a69f7ee1.svg\",\"title\":\"Atlassian Rovo\",\"description\":\"Dive into an innovative app experience with apps enhanced by Rovo Agents.\",\"redirectUrl\":\"\u002Fcollections\u002Fatlassian-rovo\"},{\"title\":\"Runs on Atlassian\",\"description\":\"Explore apps that run on Atlassian infrastructure, with data securely stored in-platform.\",\"image\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FtileImage.035a250a2fa1f5d.svg\",\"redirectUrl\":\"\u002Fcollections\u002Fruns-on-atlassian\",\"featureGate\":\"enable_two_step_app_installation_marketplace\"},{\"title\":\"Content & Communication\",\"description\":\"Enhance communication with tools designed to efficiently share information and documentation among teams.\",\"image\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FtileImage.38fdd55365d6264.svg\",\"redirectUrl\":\"\u002Fcategories\u002Fcontent-communication\"},{\"image\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FtileImage.371a0290574038e.svg\",\"title\":\"Solutions Hub\",\"description\":\"Discover curated solutions to streamline teamwork and boost productivity.\",\"redirectUrl\":\"\u002Fcollections\u002Fsolutions-hub\"},{\"title\":\"App bundles\",\"description\":\"Discover curated collections of apps to help you achieve your goals.\",\"image\":\"\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FtileImage.cef56891c3b1dfa.svg\",\"redirectUrl\":\"\u002Fapp-bundles\",\"featureGate\":\"enable_app_bundles\"}]}}"},"rule_id":"1r4eeaZihyBahZN7W6YZNU","secondary_exposures":[],"group":"1r4eeaZihyBahZN7W6YZNU","is_device_based":false,"id_type":"marketplaceAnonymousId","passed":true},"898835465":{"name":"898835465","value":{"value":["staging","production"]},"rule_id":"3w9TLGVV9rHSy1MnYFIZVo:100.00:1","secondary_exposures":[],"group":"3w9TLGVV9rHSy1MnYFIZVo:100.00:1","is_device_based":false,"id_type":"marketplaceAnonymousId","passed":true},"966184560":{"name":"966184560","value":{"value":["3f4feb88-c4e6-4156-839c-6d3f0522183e","3f97e0d7-a8ca-4263-91bf-3015999c8e64","8d1f3751-9e3a-46cb-99ac-37674eeb5dd6"]},"rule_id":"default","secondary_exposures":[],"group":"default","is_device_based":false,"id_type":"marketplaceAnonymousId","passed":false},"1092622651":{"name":"1092622651","value":{"value":"{\"TRANSACTION_ACCOUNT_INACTIVE\":{\"enabled\":true,\"message\":{\"title\":\"We're unable to install this app\",\"body\":\"Your billing account is deactivated for this site, so you can't install new apps. To resolve this, talk to a billing admin or contact support.\"},\"actions\":[{\"label\":\"Contact support\",\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fsupport.atlassian.com\",\"type\":\"secondary\"},{\"label\":\"Got it\",\"type\":\"dismiss\"}]},\"ORDER_IN_PROGRESS\":{\"enabled\":true,\"message\":{\"title\":\"We're unable to install this app\",\"body\":\"Another installation or change is already in progress for this site, so we can't start a new one. Try again in a few minutes or contact support if this keeps happening.\"},\"actions\":[{\"label\":\"Contact support\",\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fsupport.atlassian.com\",\"type\":\"secondary\"},{\"label\":\"Got it\",\"type\":\"dismiss\"}]},\"FORBIDDEN\":{\"enabled\":true,\"message\":{\"title\":\"We're unable to install this app\",\"body\":\"You need to be an admin to install apps. If you think you should have access, contact support or try again sometime.\"},\"actions\":[{\"label\":\"About app installation\",\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fsupport.atlassian.com\u002Forganization-administration\u002Fdocs\u002Finstalling-and-managing-app-access\",\"type\":\"secondary\"},{\"label\":\"Got it\",\"type\":\"dismiss\"}]},\"RESOURCE_LOCKED\":{\"enabled\":true,\"message\":{\"title\":\"We're unable to process your request\",\"body\":\"An installation is already in progress, so we can't start a new one. Try again in a few minutes or contact support if this keeps happening.\"},\"actions\":[{\"label\":\"Contact support\",\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fsupport.atlassian.com\",\"type\":\"secondary\"},{\"label\":\"Got it\",\"type\":\"dismiss\"}]},\"UNAUTHENTICATED\":{\"enabled\":true,\"message\":{\"title\":\"We're unable to process your request\",\"body\":\"You need to be a billing admin to perform this action. If you think you should have access, talk to an organization admin.\"},\"actions\":[{\"label\":\"About billing administration\",\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fsupport.atlassian.com\u002Fsubscriptions-and-billing\u002Fdocs\u002Funderstand-billing-administration\",\"type\":\"secondary\"},{\"label\":\"Got it\",\"type\":\"dismiss\"}]},\"APP_ENTITLEMENT_SUSPENDED_USER_CANCELLATION\":{\"enabled\":true,\"message\":{\"title\":\"We're unable to load the app\",\"body\":\"The subscription is no longer active because it was canceled. To continue your work, resubscribe in your billing settings or contact your admin.\"},\"actions\":[{\"label\":\"Resubscribe\",\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fadmin.atlassian.com\u002Fbilling\u002F{txAccountId}\u002Fentitlement\u002F{entitlementId}\",\"fallbackUrl\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fadmin.atlassian.com\u002Fbilling\",\"type\":\"primary\"},{\"label\":\"Dismiss\",\"type\":\"dismiss\"}]},\"APP_ENTITLEMENT_SUSPENDED_SUSPENDED_PAYMENT\":{\"enabled\":true,\"message\":{\"title\":\"We're unable to load the app\",\"body\":\"We couldn't process the payment for your subscription, so it's no longer active. To continue your work, update your payment method or contact your billing admin.\"},\"actions\":[{\"label\":\"Update payment method\",\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fadmin.atlassian.com\u002Fbilling\",\"type\":\"primary\"},{\"label\":\"Dismiss\",\"type\":\"dismiss\"}]},\"APP_ENTITLEMENT_SUSPENDED_OTHER\":{\"enabled\":true,\"message\":{\"title\":\"We're unable to load the app\",\"body\":\"There's an issue with your account that's preventing access to this app. To continue using it, contact support to resolve the issue.\"},\"actions\":[{\"label\":\"Contact support\",\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fsupport.atlassian.com\",\"type\":\"primary\"},{\"label\":\"Dismiss\",\"type\":\"dismiss\"}]},\"APP_ENTITLEMENT_SUSPENDED\":{\"enabled\":true,\"message\":{\"title\":\"We're unable to load the app\",\"body\":\"The subscription is no longer active. To continue your work, contact support or your admin to resolve the issue.\"},\"actions\":[{\"label\":\"Contact support\",\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fsupport.atlassian.com\",\"type\":\"primary\"},{\"label\":\"Dismiss\",\"type\":\"dismiss\"}]},\"PARENT_ENTITLEMENT_SCHEDULED_FOR_CANCELLATION\":{\"enabled\":true,\"message\":{\"title\":\"We're unable to install the app\",\"body\":\"Your {product} subscription is scheduled for cancellation. To install new apps, you'll need to resume your subscription first.\"},\"actions\":[{\"label\":\"Resubscribe\",\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fadmin.atlassian.com\u002Fbilling\u002F{txAccountId}\u002Fentitlement\u002F{entitlementId}?tab=BILLING_PROFILE\",\"fallbackUrl\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fadmin.atlassian.com\u002Fbilling\",\"type\":\"primary\"},{\"label\":\"Dismiss\",\"type\":\"dismiss\"}]},\"APP_ALREADY_PROVISIONED_WITH_LEGACY_OFFERING\":{\"enabled\":true,\"message\":{\"title\":\"We're unable to install this app\",\"body\":\"This app has a previous subscription on your site that is inactive and needs to be cleared before you can install it again. To resolve this, contact support.\"},\"actions\":[{\"label\":\"Contact support\",\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fsupport.atlassian.com\",\"type\":\"primary\"},{\"label\":\"Dismiss\",\"type\":\"dismiss\"}]},\"INSTALL_IN_PROGRESS\":{\"enabled\":true,\"message\":{\"title\":\"Installation in progress\",\"body\":\"We're still processing your previous request for installation. Wait a few minutes and try again. If the issue continues, contact support.\"},\"actions\":[{\"label\":\"Dismiss\",\"type\":\"dismiss\"},{\"label\":\"Contact support\",\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fsupport.atlassian.com\",\"type\":\"primary\"}]},\"ORDER_SUCCESS_PROVISIONING_IN_PROGRESS\":{\"enabled\":true,\"message\":{\"title\":\"Installation in progress\",\"body\":\"We’re still setting up this app. Wait a few minutes and try again. If the issue continues, contact support.\"},\"actions\":[{\"label\":\"Dismiss\",\"type\":\"dismiss\"},{\"label\":\"Contact support\",\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fsupport.atlassian.com\",\"type\":\"primary\"}]},\"INSTALL_FAILED_REACH_SUPPORT\":{\"enabled\":true,\"message\":{\"title\":\"We're unable to install this app\",\"body\":\"We couldn’t finish setting up this app. Contact support to resolve this and try again.\"},\"actions\":[{\"label\":\"Dismiss\",\"type\":\"dismiss\"},{\"label\":\"Contact support\",\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fsupport.atlassian.com\",\"type\":\"primary\"}]}}"},"rule_id":"1cZADuybtJWaiZmhiShvbZ:100.00:11-1cZADsT91rMFZzOlHKlRSX","secondary_exposures":[],"group":"1cZADuybtJWaiZmhiShvbZ:100.00:11-1cZADsT91rMFZzOlHKlRSX","is_device_based":false,"id_type":"atlassianAccountId","passed":true},"1233535721":{"name":"1233535721","value":{"isExperienceEnabled":false,"isExperimentalScoreV2Enabled":false},"rule_id":"3xLM7WvnymmpWi8lwbItnM","secondary_exposures":[{"gate":"2737730554","gateValue":"false","ruleID":"default"},{"gate":"2387813457","gateValue":"true","ruleID":"25DyLuaTJQWNlfq79K3FgF:100.00:15"}],"group":"3xLM7WvnymmpWi8lwbItnM","is_user_in_experiment":true,"is_experiment_active":true,"is_device_based":false,"group_name":"Control","id_type":"marketplaceAnonymousId"},"1238599662":{"name":"1238599662","value":{"value":["com.herocoders.plugins.jira.issuechecklist-free","io.tempo.jira","io.bloompeak.jira-reports-free","com.adaptavist.jira.scriptrunner.behaviours","com.atlassian.jenkins-for-jira"]},"rule_id":"default","secondary_exposures":[],"group":"default","is_device_based":false,"id_type":"marketplaceAnonymousId","passed":false},"1444036651":{"name":"1444036651","value":{},"rule_id":"!code_defaults:override","secondary_exposures":[],"group":"!code_defaults:override","is_user_in_experiment":false,"is_experiment_active":true,"is_device_based":false,"id_type":"marketplaceAnonymousId"},"1458229668":{"name":"1458229668","value":{"value":"{\"enabled\": true, \"text\": \"Authorize the collection of session data and activity from third-party agents to be automatically written to your Jira work items and aggregate dashboards. Please ensure your session content complies with all applicable policies before initiating the agent.\"}"},"rule_id":"48xKhvf0oa6PSECDHJ19UG-a0c14ac8-7381-458b-8dfe-8426bebcb8b1","secondary_exposures":[],"group":"48xKhvf0oa6PSECDHJ19UG-a0c14ac8-7381-458b-8dfe-8426bebcb8b1","is_device_based":false,"id_type":"marketplaceAnonymousId","passed":true},"1630345362":{"name":"1630345362","value":{"value":["3f4feb88-c4e6-4156-839c-6d3f0522183e","8d1f3751-9e3a-46cb-99ac-37674eeb5dd6","78654d19-c0e5-4f2c-b470-457802bf253d","f136c630-985e-4fa7-941d-399285bdd9ee","b1e7fb50-cbe6-4c20-bd05-3687d6b10bbf","58f51273-1392-448d-b524-7c611e901c73","e8c9ff5e-b980-43b2-a2dc-733a1426985d","34265142-0cc1-4698-9417-196a4b951c38","0a37c16e-6d4b-4ffb-b87e-baa7ba2af663","715bf196-f6d3-4e37-a36f-b1960015e9e8","8f8d4f58-6699-4f4a-b374-225e2b423305"]},"rule_id":"default","secondary_exposures":[],"group":"default","is_device_based":false,"id_type":"marketplaceAnonymousId","passed":false},"1663402676":{"name":"1663402676","value":{"isExperienceEnabled":true},"rule_id":"697HTJsNtlA7XY8CAg0DTu:override","secondary_exposures":[{"gate":"2999610856","gateValue":"true","ruleID":"6jwKBuEVTh71mt1WQPN30g"}],"group":"697HTJsNtlA7XY8CAg0DTu:override","is_user_in_experiment":false,"is_experiment_active":false,"is_device_based":false,"group_name":"Test","id_type":"marketplaceAnonymousId"},"1703075346":{"name":"1703075346","value":{},"rule_id":"prestart","secondary_exposures":[],"group":"prestart","is_device_based":false,"id_type":"userID"},"2524376152":{"name":"2524376152","value":{},"rule_id":"targetingGate","secondary_exposures":[{"gate":"1452413010","gateValue":"false","ruleID":"default"}],"group":"targetingGate","is_user_in_experiment":false,"is_experiment_active":true,"is_device_based":false,"id_type":"tenantId"},"2657417371":{"name":"2657417371","value":{"ShowAppInstallButton":true},"rule_id":"5Ta4fWDHWSXrwbiwOIQeS4","secondary_exposures":[],"group":"5Ta4fWDHWSXrwbiwOIQeS4","is_user_in_experiment":true,"is_experiment_active":true,"is_device_based":false,"group_name":"Test","id_type":"marketplaceAnonymousId"},"3095448074":{"name":"3095448074","value":{"value":"{\"hr-ops\":{\"hero\":{\"title\":\"HR ops, connected end-to-end – powered by Marketplace apps\",\"breadcrumbTitle\":\"HR Ops\",\"description\":\"More tools should add capability, not complexity. Marketplace apps turn Jira, Confluence, and Jira Service Management into one HR hub that grows as your team does. From sourcing to compliance, everyone stays in one platform — focused on people, not process.\",\"image\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fmarketplace.stg.internal.atlassian.com\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fmedia\u002Fhero.a8fe5067622fb794c5194d57732bbab0.svg\"},\"keyCallouts\":{\"title\":\"Transform your HR operation today\",\"description\":\"One platform. Every HR workflow. From first resume to final audit.\",\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Attract and hire\",\"description\":\"Get the right roles opened, aligned with the right recruiters, and move candidates forward efficiently.\",\"icon\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fmarketplace.stg.internal.atlassian.com\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FtileImage.2f51031e5c15b96.svg\",\"ctaText\":\"Explore apps\",\"ctaLink\":\"#key-callouts-1\"},{\"title\":\"Onboarding\",\"description\":\"New hires are fully equipped, productive, and embedded from Day 1 with zero manual handoffs.\",\"icon\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fmarketplace.stg.internal.atlassian.com\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FtileImage.dac1f7050519cc8.svg\",\"ctaText\":\"Explore apps\",\"ctaLink\":\"#key-callouts-2\"},{\"title\":\"Compliance and reporting\",\"description\":\"Clean audit trails and real-time data, no more spreadsheet gymnastics.\",\"icon\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fmarketplace.stg.internal.atlassian.com\u002Famkt-frontend-static\u002Fstatic-assets\u002Fimages\u002FtileImage.c2dc802407de1f0.svg\",\"ctaText\":\"Explore apps\",\"ctaLink\":\"#key-callouts-3\"}]},\"featuredApps\":[{\"title\":\"Attract and hire\",\"id\":\"key-callouts-1\",\"description\":\"Faster hiring, fewer missed targets, and full pipeline visibility without leaving your Atlassian tools.\",\"before\":[\"Recruiter bandwidth managed in spreadsheets\",\"No visibility into where candidates are stuck\",\"Interview scheduling siloed across email and calendar\",\"Time-to-hire tracked in Excel with no live view of what's working\"],\"after\":[\"Real-time recruiter bandwidth planning before roles open\",\"Spot exactly where candidates get stuck\",\"Interview scheduling synced directly into Jira via Outlook\",\"Live funnel dashboards and pipeline health metrics\"],\"appsHeaderText\":\"Explore apps that get you there\",\"apps\":[{\"key\":\"com.reliex.activitytimeline.cloud.atlassian.connect\",\"note\":\"See recruiter capacity before opening new roles\"},{\"key\":\"com.obss.plugin.time-in-status\",\"note\":\"Spot where candidates are stuck in the funnel\"},{\"key\":\"com.yasoon.jira.cloud\",\"note\":\"Interview scheduling via Outlook, synced to Jira\"},{\"key\":\"com.oldstreetsolutions.atlassian.jira.custom-charts\",\"note\":\"Live dashboards for pipeline health and diversity metrics\"}]},{\"title\":\"Onboarding\",\"id\":\"key-callouts-2\",\"description\":\"A better employee experience from Day 1 — accounts, assets, and access waiting for them before they walk in the door.\",\"before\":[\"Manual emails between HR and IT to provision accounts and assets\",\"New hires spend Day 1 waiting for logins and chasing IT\",\"Disorganized intranet — hard for a new hire to find the info they need\",\"Task routing is one-size-fits-all, often missed\",\"No cross-team coordination for large cohorts\"],\"after\":[\"Zero-touch sync from HRIS — accounts and assets ready before Day 1\",\"Onboarding tasks auto-routed to the right teams\",\"Branded self-service HR portal — everything in one place\",\"Tasks tailored by employee type (FTE, contractor, intern)\",\"Large cohort programs managed with full dependency mapping\"],\"appsHeaderText\":\"Explore apps that get you there\",\"apps\":[{\"key\":\"com.onwardb.apps.onlink\",\"note\":\"Sync accounts and assets from HRIS before Day 1\"},{\"key\":\"com.onresolve.jira.groovy.groovyrunner\",\"note\":\"Auto-route onboarding tasks to the right teams\"},{\"key\":\"com.almworks.jira.structure\",\"note\":\"Manage large cohorts with full dependency mapping\"},{\"key\":\"com.refinedwiki.cloud.refinedsites\",\"note\":\"Branded self-service HR portal, everything in one place\"},{\"key\":\"eu.softwareplant.bigpicture\",\"note\":\"Plan onboarding programs with timelines and dependencies\"}]},{\"title\":\"Compliance and reporting\",\"id\":\"key-callouts-3\",\"description\":\"Reduced compliance risk, data you can trust, and reports that build themselves\",\"before\":[\"Policies buried in a messy wiki with no approval trail\",\"Hours tracked manually in separate tools\",\"Leadership reports built by combining spreadsheets\",\"Hours spent combining data sources for analytics\"],\"after\":[\"Formal approval workflows with a full, searchable audit trail\",\"Automated hour capture for payroll and regulatory compliance\",\"Real-time department budgets and headcount costs\",\"JSM + HRIS data surfaced automatically to leadership\"],\"appsHeaderText\":\"Explore apps that get you there\",\"apps\":[{\"key\":\"com.comalatech.workflow\",\"note\":\"Formal approval workflows with a full audit trail\"},{\"key\":\"is.origo.jira.tempo-plugin\",\"note\":\"Automated hour capture for payroll compliance\"},{\"key\":\"io.tempo.cost-tracker\",\"note\":\"Real-time department budgets and headcount costs\"},{\"key\":\"com.alphaserve.powerbi-connector-jira\",\"note\":\"Surface JSM and HRIS data to leadership automatically\"},{\"key\":\"com.mxgraph.confluence.plugins.diagramly\",\"note\":\"Document and visualize compliance processes\"}]}],\"cta\":{\"title\":\"Ready to transform your HR operation?\",\"description\":\"From role approval to Day 1 readiness, turn disconnected HR workflows into a scalable, end-to-end people ops hub — powered by Marketplace apps.\",\"ctaText\":\"Explore more Marketplace apps \",\"ctaLink\":\"\u002Fcategories\u002Fhr-team\"}}}"},"rule_id":"default","secondary_exposures":[],"group":"default","is_device_based":false,"id_type":"marketplaceAnonymousId","passed":false},"3315629633":{"name":"3315629633","value":{},"rule_id":"prestart","secondary_exposures":[],"group":"prestart","is_user_in_experiment":false,"is_experiment_active":false,"is_device_based":false,"id_type":"marketplaceAnonymousId"},"3418984376":{"name":"3418984376","value":{},"rule_id":"prestart","secondary_exposures":[],"group":"prestart","is_device_based":false,"id_type":"marketplaceAnonymousId"},"3737861582":{"name":"3737861582","value":{},"rule_id":"prestart","secondary_exposures":[],"group":"prestart","is_user_in_experiment":false,"is_experiment_active":false,"is_device_based":false,"id_type":"marketplaceAnonymousId"},"3744878946":{"name":"3744878946","value":{"position":"none"},"rule_id":"launchedGroup","secondary_exposures":[{"gate":"4065756092","gateValue":"true","ruleID":"2bqtIhPhV7Ymyw9yJA61Cl:30.00:9"}],"group":"launchedGroup","is_user_in_experiment":false,"is_experiment_active":false,"is_device_based":false,"group_name":"Control","id_type":"marketplaceAnonymousId"},"3803147692":{"name":"3803147692","value":{"value":["1237510","1237509","1237412","1359918","1353035","1359018","1353904","1353919","1327107","1327363","1329442","1329444","1329448","1329456","1329459","1327370","1211273","1275089","1328867","1328893","1327438","1323724","1327444","1226684","1327370","1248014","1329512","1327350","1327409","1329516","1329517","1329518","1329519","1329520","1329521","1329522","1329523","1329524","1329525","1329526","1329527","1327423","1329531","1329537